# Language Test 202505 - AHC040A: Packing Uncertain Rectangles
# Simple valid interactive baseline: place every rectangle in one horizontal chain.
Sonome kas N kasta T kasta sigma tas Kisite kas readints vis 3.
Sonome kas observed tas [].
Sonome kas pair tas [0, 0].
Pilike kas i pas Kisite kas pilika vis N {
    Kemese kas pair tas Kisite kas readints vis 2.
    Putike kas pair tas observed.
}
Sonome kas feedback tas [0, 0].
Sonome kas base tas -1.
Pilike kas turn pas Kisite kas pilika vis T {
    Takute kas N.
    Kemese kas base tas -1.
    Pilike kas i pas Kisite kas pilika vis N {
        Takute kas [i, 0, "U", base] vis " ".
        Kemese kas base tas i.
    }
    Kisite kas flush.
    Kemese kas feedback tas Kisite kas readints vis 2.
}
